 (4).png", "id": "1327505929431978", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MPPXg5SRIUAQ7kNvwEhxukP&_nc_oc=AdrGhyj80R4yr3JupGBrCT3NPQUisePPcPQ7EKteomqOvytLUZliboQx5rZ3UnokZfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKOf2vfPNbTcXv1K63h8srr_tGtrw0Jd7tZkCEZlUg7rQ&oe=6ABA5A64"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ag0QNoKrl8UQ7kNvwFmnaMo&_nc_oc=Adq2MEDNklFrservLuVwB_vUpcPe1z_wr5PBnfg_JlKeJlGN2GOrT3iRMc8Buo2M8Zs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJzD8XUw6GcNmOHLubKpmyITdqQn7_NqaUt4jv8aFcPJg&oe=6ABA6DD7"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X_TmtipBckQQ7kNvwFFOn6l&_nc_oc=AdpoVamSLui8rlR2OUz6-NIFEyE1daO1Ni28NhI7zshVuySL2q21VtlA1bxrug6LHSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvrJaLicYO-qnJJrD7jCz3Wh15PAQ7tt7pP1855HQeUw&oe=6ABA84E2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o793GZxXaT4Q7kNvwEbf1WC&_nc_oc=AdqzvY78KG3sPbk1CEE4BUqGhEeOar7eg4HTii_4THa1CcQvhmGTD2OMTeLkZzQhQoA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGtXihNQhxhMZ7Z_FUABYe8ml2ay-GrhJPUkl2oEZnYg&oe=6ABA7FDB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_2.0_Part-1_KeyArt_2560x1440.png", "id": "3470412146474631", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_3470412149807964_2463849604663011550_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RKKEsO9e6scQ7kNvwGGSXqo&_nc_oc=Adp5p1ATwfF5svRPJ4PPQtK7-7gtPwTcUKImDZWsjBCpCooI3dV3rWwfMm7KwyVKBlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKnM1KfSEuU_U0KJKzWHnIQ7qlziIh-gWQ5FEq_r1OWtg&oe=6ABA82A0"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://w